00:30:19,400 --> 00:30:27,560
 So within the muscle, we have many numbers of fascicles, and this is surrounded by paramecium.

356
00:30:27,560 --> 00:30:32,000
 So we know that a muscle consists of hundreds, two thousands of muscle cells, plus connective

357
00:30:32,000 --> 00:30:36,600
 tissue wrappings, the blood vessels and nerve fibers.

358
00:30:36,600 --> 00:30:40,760
 The whole entire muscle, again, is covered by epimesium.

359
00:30:40,760 --> 00:30:47,900
 The muscle fascicle surrounded by paramecium is a discrete bundle of muscle cells, a segregate

