00:30:47,900 --> 00:30:54,640
 from the rest of the muscle by, again, another connective tissue sheath.

361
00:30:54,640 --> 00:31:00,120
 Muscle fascicles are made up of individual muscle fibers or muscle cells.

362
00:31:00,120 --> 00:31:08,040
 These muscle fibers are surrounded by endo-museum, and then a muscle fiber is an elongated multinucleate

363
00:31:08,040 --> 00:31:15,280
 cell, has striations that we saw in the histo slides.

364
00:31:15,280 --> 00:31:19,440
 And then individual muscle cells or muscle fibers are surrounded by endo-museum.

