00:31:24,760 --> 00:31:31,880
 So these are complex organelles containing myofilaments, such as our actinar myosin.

367
00:31:31,880 --> 00:31:39,920
 Myofibrils are rod-like contractile organelles that occupy most of the muscle cell volume,

368
00:31:39,920 --> 00:31:46,960
 composed of the structural units called sarcomeres that are arranged end-to-end, appear banded,

