00:31:46,960 --> 00:31:52,640
 and the bands of adjacent myofibrils are, of course, aligned.

370
00:31:52,640 --> 00:31:57,760
 And then within the myofibrils, we have the structural unit, which is the sarcomere, again,

371
00:31:57,760 --> 00:32:02,620
 a segment of myofibril, which will go from z-disc to z-disc.

372
00:32:02,620 --> 00:32:10,720
 Again, this is the contractile unit composed of the myofilaments, actin and myosin, which

373
00:32:10,720 --> 00:32:12,720
 are made up of contractile proteins.

374
00:32:12,720 --> 00:32:19,360
 So we have the thick myosin filaments and the thin actin filaments.

375
00:32:19,360 --> 00:32:23,960
 So here we see the myofilaments or filaments.

