00:32:35,960 --> 00:32:42,320
 And then kind of overlapping, we have the thin actin filaments.

379
00:32:42,320 --> 00:32:49,240
 So we have, again, two types of myofilaments, thick and thin, contained bundled depending

380
00:32:49,240 --> 00:32:50,720
 on if they're thick or thin.

381
00:32:50,720 --> 00:32:57,920
 The thick filaments have bundled myosin, whereas the thin filaments have bundled actin.

382
00:32:57,920 --> 00:33:03,080
 And the sliding of the thin filaments past the thick filaments will produce muscle shortening

383
00:33:03,080 --> 00:33:06,400
 or muscle contraction.

384
00:33:06,400 --> 00:33:12,280
 We also have elastic filaments that are composed of titan molecules that maintain the organization

