00:35:58,160 --> 00:36:07,240
 You just want one stimulus to occur and then once the stimulus has released a signal into

419
00:36:07,240 --> 00:36:19,640
 the muscle fiber that will break down acetylcholine so that we only have a single muscle twitch.

420
00:36:19,640 --> 00:36:24,280
 So we can see that the axons of the motor neurons will extend from the spinal cord to

421
00:36:24,280 --> 00:36:30,680
 the muscle, there each axon will divide into a number of terminal butons that form neuromuscular

