00:36:30,680 --> 00:36:35,800
 junctions with muscle fibers that are scattered throughout the muscle and we can here see

423
00:36:35,800 --> 00:36:43,000
 the that going on in this histo slide we can see branching axon of a motor unit and then

424
00:36:43,000 --> 00:36:52,400
 terminal butons at neuromuscular junctions onto the muscle fibers.

425
00:36:52,400 --> 00:36:59,080
 So different types of skeletal muscle fibers they are categorized according to two characteristics.

