00:37:18,520 --> 00:37:24,040
 What does that mean, aerobically means there needs to be the presence of oxygen and then

431
00:37:24,040 --> 00:37:31,040
 we have glycolytic fibers, glycolytic fibers will produce ATP anaerobically so anaerobically

