00:37:31,040 --> 00:37:37,240
 meaning without oxygen but we do it they are able to produce ATP through glycolysis.

433
00:37:37,240 --> 00:37:44,080
 So glycolysis is basically the breakdown of the stored form of glucose which is glycogen.

