00:38:29,440 --> 00:38:36,640
 An example of this are the white fast glycolytic fibers which we'll talk about and then intermediate

442
00:38:36,640 --> 00:38:39,640
 we have our fast oxidative fibers.

443
00:38:39,640 --> 00:38:47,160
 So these are intermediate fibers again oxidative requiring oxygen glycolytic do not require

